from my experience...

nXX(s)earch is broken by the appearce of a hostile monster, 
discovering something (secret door, trap), change in status 
(hunger, confusion), teleportitis, and taking a ranged attack 
(even if it might miss) ...  I wonder, if an unseen goblin were 
to throw a crude dagger off-target (say you're invisible) does 
that break the search? probably not till he appears.

nXXs isn't broken by your pet's antics or hearing things in the 
dungeon.  If your pet hits a trap while you are "in the loop" I 
still don't think it breaks, but dont bet your life (or your 
pet's) on it.  I don't think a confused from hunger pet will 
break the loop, but it will if he starts to bite you.

I think the rules are similar for (.)wait...

